# ── shmuppetry 2.5.0: performance assets stay LOCAL ───────────────────────────
# The public demo at shmuh.co/puppets is freeplay only, and needs just the "default"
# puppet collection. Everything below still lives in the working tree — the rig runs
# from disk locally exactly as before — it's simply not tracked, so it never lands in
# git or on Vercel. BACK THESE UP OUTSIDE THE REPO: git is no longer their second copy.

# training weights (potato.onnx IS tracked — jsDelivr serves it to prod from GitHub)
public/puppets/potato_model/*.pt
# race classifier (~9MB, not in the default rig)
public/puppets/face_model/

# puppet collections other than the public "default" set
public/puppets/hand_puppets/*
!public/puppets/hand_puppets/default/
public/puppets/head_puppets/*
!public/puppets/head_puppets/default/

# show media — game_script.json + rig.json stay tracked (they're the interesting
# artifact, and shmuppetry.html links one as an example); the media does not.
public/puppets/shows/*/slides/
public/puppets/shows/*/stage/
public/puppets/directory-data.json
